Step 1 :
--------
  Use Microsoft's Official Office Deployment Tool
    https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/details.aspx?id=49117 
    
    make a folder and install that microsoft tool in that (make it in to C: drive)

Step 2 :
--------
  Configuration XML File & Download
    google, office customization tool
    https://config.office.com/deploymentsettings
    
    Select,
    Architecture : 32 x 64
    Office Suits : office LTSC Standard version
    Apps         : word + excel (only whats needed)
    Language     : English
    > Export > office open XML formats

Step 3 :
--------
  Installing Office via Command Prompt
    move XML File in to the folder which was created earlier
    CMD > run as administrator
      cd C:\folder_created_earlier
      setup /configure configuration.xml

      
    
  
